      "claimKey": "triangle-midpoints/altitude-equality",
      "stance": "refutes",
      "summary": "The ancillary claim that 'the altitude from A to EF equals the altitude from A to BC' is false; the subject correction shows the perpendicular distance from A to EF is half that to BC (homothety about A with factor 1/2), so the altitude-equality statement is refuted.",
